5,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I'm curious about the ground here. I'll look at the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,Hi! I want to make sure we aren't just dreaming. I'll check the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the terms of the regional habitat fund.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I believe the past teaches us much. I shall examine the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I am interested in the operational side. I will look into the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services, as well as the volunteer groups working with the division.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's be rational. I'll investigate the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts and August heat readings.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
