30,2,1,talk,Minato,,"I found out that the earth-moving firms are worried about clay and slippage. Also, we can't hoard the center or the main gate without closing them.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,May,,"Oh dear. The habitat fund only pays for plants and water, not buildings. Plus, planted areas are way more expensive to maintain than hard surfaces.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"It seems some things last and some do not. The overflow basin is still fine, but the civic hall apron is a mess. Many young trees died too.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"Our staff is very small now, only seven posts. We buy in specialist care, but we do have volunteers for habitats and youth sports.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The data is clear. People mostly use the park as a shortcut to the tram, and the drainage is failing while the heat is rising.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, if people are just crossing through, maybe we shouldn't block the center?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, if we only have seven people, we can't afford a plan that's expensive to maintain. Those upkeep costs are scary.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, I agree. If the trees died because of poor aftercare, a dense woodland might just be a graveyard in a few years.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, that is a worrying point. We have volunteers, but they can't replace a full groundskeeping team for everything.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, exactly. Any plan that ignores the tram-stop flow or the drainage issues is just a drawing, not a reality.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Minato,,"I'm worried about the clay. If we dig too much, will it slide?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,May,,"And the funding! If the fund doesn't pay for surfacing, we'll be paying for the paths out of our own pockets.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"We should look for something that has proven to be durable, like that overflow basin.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"We must consider who is actually doing the work. We have sports volunteers, which is a helpful resource.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,We need shade and better water management. The heat readings were quite high last August.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
